## Overview
A mod concept bringing Ivy Valentine’s iconic armor sets from the Soulcalibur series into Fallout 4. This includes multiple outfit variants adapted to the Commonwealth’s aesthetic while preserving Ivy’s distinctive fantasy style.

## Core Concept
- Multiple Ivy armor variants (classic, SC3, SC4, SC5, SC6)
- High‑fantasy design adapted for Fallout’s post‑apocalyptic world
- Optional lore-friendly placement locations

## Possible Locations
- Cabot House (fits the elegant aesthetic)
- Emogene Cabot’s room (character-appropriate)
- Croup Manor basement (hidden stash)
- Fallon's Department Store (high-end fashion placement)

## Features
- Full armor sets with gloves, boots, accessories
- Optional weapon: Ivy’s snake-sword (Whip Blade)
- Crafting options at the Armor Workbench
- Male and female compatibility (optional)

## Implementation Notes
- Requires custom meshes and textures
- Possible use of existing fantasy mod assets as reference
- Physics-enabled pieces (optional)
